\begin{align*}
M_1 =
\begin{vmatrix} \cos^2 x & \csc^2 x \\ \cos^2 x & \cot^2 x \end{vmatrix} &= \cos^2 x\cdot \cot^2 x - \sin^2 x\cdot \csc^2 x \\
&= \cos^2 x\cdot \cot^2 x - 1.
\end{align*}

Next, let's compute the minor $M_2$ of the second row:
\begin{align*}
M_2 =
\begin{vmatrix} \sec^2 x & 1 \\ \csc^2 x & \cos^2 x \end{vmatrix} &= \sec^2 x\cdot \cos^2 x - \csc^2 x \\
&= \csc^2 x\cdot \sec^2 x - 1.
\end{align*}

Finally, let's compute the minor $M_3$ of the third row:
\begin{align*}
M_3 =
\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 1 \\ \cos^2 x & \csc^2 x \end{vmatrix} &= 1\cdot \csc^2 x - \cos^2 x \\
&= -\cos^2 x + \csc^2 x.
\end{align*}

Now we can finds the value for the determinant:
