Area \, of \, entire \, circle &= 16 \cdot 3.14159 \\
Area \, of \, entire \, circle &\approx 50.24028
\end{align*}
Finding the square root of this area gives us approximately:
\begin{align*}
Square \, root \, of \, area \, of \, entire \, circle &\approx \sqrt{50.24028} \\
Square \, root \, of \, area \, of \, entire \, circle &\approx 7.07107
\end{align*}
